-- Same precedence, opposite associativity (docs/NovaElaboration.txt,
-- the fixity paragraph). Climbing would settle this by WRITTEN ORDER —
-- ⊕ first folds right, ⊙ first folds left — so it is a parse error
-- naming both operators instead.
infixr 4 ⊕
infixl 4 ⊙
⊕ : ℕ → ℕ → ℕ
⊕ = λx. λy. x
⊙ : ℕ → ℕ → ℕ
⊙ = λx. λy. y
clash : ℕ
clash = 1 ⊕ 2 ⊙ 3
